{
    "chapter_num": 8,
    "verses_count": 40,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Saul Persecutes the Church"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now Saul was consenting to his death."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "At that time a great persecution arose against the church which was at Jerusalem; and they were all scattered throughout the regions of Judea and Samaria, except the apostles. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And devout men carried Stephen "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to his burial,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and made great lamentation over him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As for Saul, he made havoc of the church, entering every house, and dragging off men and women, committing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to prison."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christ Is Preached in Samaria"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore those who were scattered went everywhere preaching the word. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Philip went down to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or a"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the city of Samaria and preached Christ to them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the multitudes with one accord heeded the things spoken by Philip, hearing and seeing the miracles which he did. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For unclean spirits, crying with a loud voice, came out of many who were possessed; and many who were paralyzed and lame were healed. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And there was great joy in that city."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Sorcerer’s Profession of Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But there was a certain man called Simon, who previously practiced "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "magic"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sorcery in the city and astonished the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or nation"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "people of Samaria, claiming that he was someone great, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to whom they all gave heed, from the least to the greatest, saying, “This man is the great power of God.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they heeded him because he had astonished them with his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "magic arts"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "sorceries for a long time. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But when they believed Philip as he preached the things concerning the kingdom of God and the name of Jesus Christ, both men and women were baptized. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Simon himself also believed; and when he was baptized he continued with Philip, and was amazed, seeing the miracles and signs which were done."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Sorcerer’s Sin"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when the apostles who were at Jerusalem heard that Samaria had received the word of God, they sent Peter and John to them, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who, when they had come down, prayed for them that they might receive the Holy Spirit. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For as yet He had fallen upon none of them. They had only been baptized in the name of the Lord Jesus. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they laid hands on them, and they received the Holy Spirit."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when Simon saw that through the laying on of the apostles’ hands the Holy Spirit was given, he offered them money, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "saying, “Give me this power also, that anyone on whom I lay hands may receive the Holy Spirit.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Peter said to him, “Your money perish with you, because you thought that the gift of God could be purchased with money! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You have neither part nor portion in this matter, for your heart is not right in the sight of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Repent therefore of this your wickedness, and pray God if perhaps the thought of your heart may be forgiven you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For I see that you are poisoned by bitterness and bound by iniquity.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Simon answered and said, “Pray to the Lord for me, that none of the things which you have spoken may come upon me.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So when they had testified and preached the word of the Lord, they returned to Jerusalem, preaching the gospel in many villages of the Samaritans."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Christ Is Preached to an Ethiopian"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now an angel of the Lord spoke to Philip, saying, “Arise and go toward the south along the road which goes down from Jerusalem to Gaza.” This is "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Or a deserted place"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "desert. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he arose and went. And behold, a man of Ethiopia, a eunuch of great authority under Candace the queen of the Ethiopians, who had charge of all her treasury, and had come to Jerusalem to worship, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "was returning. And sitting in his chariot, he was reading Isaiah the prophet. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the Spirit said to Philip, “Go near and overtake this chariot.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So Philip ran to him, and heard him reading the prophet Isaiah, and said, “Do you understand what you are reading?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he said, “How can I, unless someone guides me?” And he asked Philip to come up and sit with him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The place in the Scripture which he read was this:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“He was led as a sheep to the slaughter;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And as a lamb before its shearer"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "silent,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "So He opened not His mouth."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "In His humiliation His"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "justice was taken away,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And who will declare His generation?"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "For His life is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "taken from the earth.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 34,
                    "num_str": "34",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the eunuch answered Philip and said, “I ask you, of whom does the prophet say this, of himself or of some other man?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 35,
                    "num_str": "35",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Philip opened his mouth, and beginning at this Scripture, preached Jesus to him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 36,
                    "num_str": "36",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now as they went down the road, they came to some water. And the eunuch said, “See, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "here is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " water. What hinders me from being baptized?”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 37,
                    "num_str": "37",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M omit v. 37. It is found in Western texts, including the Latin tradition."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then Philip said, “If you believe with all your heart, you may.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And he answered and said, “I believe that Jesus Christ is the Son of God.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 38,
                    "num_str": "38",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So he commanded the chariot to stand still. And both Philip and the eunuch went down into the water, and he baptized him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 39,
                    "num_str": "39",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when they came up out of the water, the Spirit of the Lord caught Philip away, so that the eunuch saw him no more; and he went on his way rejoicing. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 40,
                    "num_str": "40",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But Philip was found at "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Same as Heb. Ashdod"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Azotus. And passing through, he preached in all the cities till he came to Caesarea."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}